35,2,1,talk,Mizuki,,The shared house year was lonely. Last year we barely met. I need a place with streets.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Shizue,,"The separate rooms cost nearly 8,000 yen more. The island house is one bill.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Minato,,The island house has one bathroom and cold water. The inn has baths until midnight.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Jonathan,,The ferry takes two days. The train is only ninety minutes. The city is easy.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Midori,,"The all-in rate is fair. The valley inn is 17,000 yen with meals.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Jonathan, the train time is much better for me.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Midori, the all-in rate solves the payment issue for me.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Minato,,"@Shizue, the one bill is nice, but the bathroom worries me.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Mizuki, the city has trains every few minutes. No waiting.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Midori,,"@Minato, the inn baths are open late. That might help you.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Mizuki,,The city allows me to be alone or together. The island feels crowded.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Shizue,,"The city beds are 12,000 to 20,000 yen. Meals are extra.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Minato,,The inn has a door and no timetable. That sounds peaceful.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Jonathan,,The city is efficient. I can read in a quiet corner.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Midori,,The city cost is variable. I prefer the fixed inn rate.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Mizuki,,I am leaning towards the city for flexibility.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Shizue,,I am leaning towards the island for the simple bill.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Minato,,I am leaning towards the inn for the baths.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Jonathan,,I am leaning towards the city for the ease.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Midori,,I am leaning towards the inn for the fixed cost.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
